<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Fleming Cos, Scotsman Industries, Morgan Hydrocarbons and Corimon.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Fleming Cos, Scotsman Industries, Morgan Hydrocarbons and Corimon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday Fleming Cos Inc, Scotsman Industries Inc and Morgan Hydrocarbons were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said Corimon SACA also was unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
</text>
